OL,3,GNEWSAPolar bear returns to wildlife
OL,4,Apark after almost a year in Yorkshire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA polar bear is back at a Scottish park
OL,7,Fafter spending almost a year in
OL,8,FYorkshire.
OL,10,FBrodie was born at the Highland
OL,11,FWildlife Park, near Aviemore, in
OL,12,FDecember 2021.
OL,14,FHe was moved temporarily to Doncaster's
OL,15,FYorkshire Wildlife Park Resort while
OL,16,Fmaintenance work was carried out on his
OL,17,Fenclosure.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,428,420,260,160,0,100
