OL,3,GNEWSAPolar bear returns to wildlife
OL,4,Apark after almost a year in Yorkshire
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Royal Zoological Society of
OL,7,FScotland (RZSS) said he had now
OL,8,Freturned north with Luka, an older bear
OL,9,Fhe had developed a bond with while at
OL,10,Fthe resort.
